SCHQUO,	TAD	CSP
	TAD	(40	/A NULL SEARCH STRING MEANS USE THE
	SZA CLA		/PREV CONTENTS OF THE SEARCH BUFFER, ELSE
	DCA I	SXR	/STORE TERMINATING 0 AND BEGIN THE SEARCH
CSST,	TAD	P
	DCA	CSP
	JMP	CSF+1
