	TAD	NMT
	SMA CLA
	JMP	CHKCLN	/FAILED, SET VALUE & EXIT
	TAD	CSP	/FIGURE OUT OFFSET TO FAKE OUT "I" ROUTINE
	CIA		/SO THAT WE HAVE THE RIGHT INSERTION COUNT
