	DCA I	P
	CDF 0
	ISZ	P
	JMP I	STOREC
/SEARCH STRING MODIFIERS:

SCHLST,	16	/^N - ANYTHING BUT
	21	/^Q - LITERALLY
	23	/^S - ANY SEPARATOR
	30	/^X - ANYTHING

/G COMMAND

